.DS_Store
**/node_modules/
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*credentials*
**/*secret*

# Private product repositories and local tooling are outside this project.
/reference/
/flyai-agent-preferences/
/tooling/

# Runtime state, raw traces, captured backend responses and model transcripts.
/agent/local-state/
/agent/traces/
/agent/eval-results/
*.log

# Local launchers contain machine-specific paths.
*.command

# Earlier internal planning notes are not part of the reviewable agent layer.
/AGENT-SPEC.md
/BACKLOG.md
/SEARCH-SCOPE.md
/DEPLOYMENT.md
/agent/README.md


# Historical internal verification notes are retained locally only.
/agent/OUTPUT-REVIEW.md
/agent/POLICY-MEMORY-VERIFICATION.md
